{"license":"CC0-1.0","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Talk of Europe - The debates of the European Parliament as Linked Open Data"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"TalkOfEurope"}},{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:76464"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"L.H. Hollink"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"CWI"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"A.V.A. van Aggelen"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"VU University Amsterdam"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"H.B. Beunders"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Erasmus University Rotterdam"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"M.K. Kleppe"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"VU University Amsterdam"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"M.K. Kemman"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"University of Luxembourg"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"J van Ossenbruggen"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Centrum Wiskunde & Informatica"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"L.  Hollink"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Centrum Wiskunde & Informatica"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>The Talk of Europe (TOE) project has created a Linked Open Dataset with data from and about the European Parliament (EP). The proceedings of the parliamentary debates as published by the EP, including all available translations, were converted to RDF and enriched with datasets of biographical and political information about the speakers. The ToE project officially ran from from 2014 to 2015 and has continued to make improved and updated versions of the data available online. The current dataset that is archived here contains all debates from summer 1999 until summer 2017.<\/p><p>The dataset is documented in a publication: Astrid van Aggelen, Laura Hollink, Max Kemman, Martijn Kleppe, Henri Beunders. The debates of the European Parliament as Linked Open Data. Semantic Web, vol. 8, no. 2, pp. 271-281, 2017, IOS Press. A pre-print is added to this dataset as onderzoeksdocumentatie_preprint.pdf. This pre-print relates to the previous version of this dataset. Changes to the dataset with respect to the descrition in the publication are listed in the file Changes.txt.<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>The research documentation is in English.<\/p><p>Please note, the data files can not be downloaded all at once. Please contact DANS via info@dans.knaw.nl to obtain all data files at once.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"European Parliament"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Linked Open Data"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Open Government Data"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"multilingual data"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch","English","French","German"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2017-09-07"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"B.H. Høyland (University of Oslo)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"M. Marx (University of Amsterdam)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"S.G. Giannini (Università degli studi di Bari Aldo Moro)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Funding Agency: Clarin ERIC and Clarin-NL."}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2017-09-07"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2017-12-13"},{"typeName":"dataSources","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["The verbatim reports of the plenary meetings of the EP, as found on the Europarl website via portal http:\/\/www.europarl.europa.eu